@user-16 Thanks for requesting the integration. FYI it was asked before to add this logger: #5921. 

It was decided a while ago that we no longer add new experiment tracking frameworks to the core of Lightning due to maintenance overhead. We recommend to have the integration be part of the 3rd party library and potentially integrate testing with the [Ecosystem CI](https://pytorch-lightning.readthedocs.io/en/stable/ecosystem/ecosystem-ci.html). 

cc @user-4 @user-2 @user-17

how about doing it manually?
```py
class LitModel(LightningModule):
    def __init__(self):
        ...

    def on_fit_start(self):
        self = self.to(memory_format=torch.channels_last)
```

```py
class LitModel(LightningModule):
    def __init__(self):
        ...

    def on_fit_start(self):
        self = self.to(memory_format=torch.channels_last)

    def on_after_batch_transfer(self, batch, *args, **kwargs):
        batch = batch.to(memory_format=torch.channels_last)
        return batch
```

haven't checked more in defail, but based on your info, I guess this should work
